AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::setFeeRecipient()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when new fee recipient is zero address
│   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketZeroAddress
└── when new fee recipient is nonzero
    ├── it should update feeRecipient
    ├── when new recipient equals current recipient
    │   └── it should still emit and leave the same value
    ├── it should emit SetFeeRecipient with old and new addresses
    ├── it should mint only to the new recipient on subsequent claimInterest calls
    ├── it should redirect all already accrued claimableFeesAssets to the new recipient
    ├── it should remove claim permission from the former recipient unless it is owner
    ├── it should not accrue interest or change accounting
    └── it should remain callable while paused or frozen
